.TH HOPCHAT 1 "2026" "hopchat 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hopchat \- offline, end-to-end encrypted terminal chat for your local network
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hopchat
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
hopchat is a terminal chat app built on the Offline Protocol SDK.
Peers on the same network discover each other over UDP multicast and DNS-SD;
every conversation is end-to-end encrypted with MLS (RFC 9420).
No server, no internet, no accounts.
.PP
Run hopchat on two machines on the same network:
.PP
.RS
hopchat \-\-name alice    # on one machine
.br
hopchat \-\-name bob      # on another
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-name ", " \-n " " \fINICK\fR
What peers see you as (default: $USER).
.TP
.BR \-\-dir " " \fIPATH\fR
Where identity and history live (default: ~/.hopchat/NICK).
.TP
.BR \-\-downloads " " \fIPATH\fR
Where received files are saved (default: ~/Downloads/hopchat).
.TP
.BR \-\-theme " " \fINAME\fR
dark or light (default: last /theme, else the terminal's).
.TP
.B \-\-echo
No UI: answer every message (a bot to test against).
.TP
.BR \-\-say " " \fITEXT\fR
No UI: send TEXT to the first peer that connects.
.TP
.BR \-\-file " " \fIPATH\fR
No UI: send the file at PATH to the first peer that connects.
.TP
.BR \-\-to " " \fINICK\fR
With \-\-say/\-\-file: only send to a peer with this nick.
.TP
.B \-\-lobby
With \-\-say: say it in the lobby, once the first peer (or \-\-to NICK) has a session.
.TP
.BR \-\-group " " \fINAME\fR
No UI: create group NAME, invite peers as they connect, and \-\-say into the group.
.TP
.B \-\-home
With \-\-group: let the group use this machine's devices.
.TP
.B \-\-ai
With \-\-group: let the group ask this machine's model with @ai.
.TP
.BR \-\-help ", " \-h
Print usage and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.hopchat/<name>/
Identity, history and settings per profile.
.TP
.I ~/Downloads/hopchat
Where received files are saved by default.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.RS
hopchat \-\-name alice
.br
hopchat \-\-name bot \-\-echo
.br
hopchat \-\-name alice \-\-say "hello" \-\-to bob
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation: <https://github.com/bahdotsh/hopchat>
.SH AUTHOR
Written by bahdotsh.
